[2026-09-08 03:33:46] REQ 260908033143-23 START backend=Ollama model=deepseek-v4-flash:cloud msgs=46 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_2dzezikc","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && grep -n \"^\\* \" audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org | tail -3; echo \"=== last entry ===\"; sed -n '5001,5040p' audit/iar/continuo/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[03:33:46] 4998:* 2026-09-08 cycle 122 -- quiet pulse\n5000:* 2026-09-08 cycle 122 -- recovery prompt fired (text-only loop on close-out). Cycle was already complete and committed; this is a false-positive spiral on the close sequence. Landing now.\n5001:* 2026-09-08 cycle 123 -- the fence learned to see its own house\n=== last entry ===\n* 2026-09-08 cycle 123 -- the fence learned to see its own house\n\nAria's c54/c55 autopsy found the output-runaway fence firing on gptel's\nown tool-call display blocks: ~95 tool blocks, 5211 lines, 131 ```\nand 66 identical truncated previews -- zero model repetition. The\nfence counted its own house's scaffolding because\nbuffer-substring-no-properties strips the very text-properties that\nmark machine-inserted regions.\n\nThe fix was in my domain (the runaway census is mine). New helper\niar--cycle-response-text walks the region by 'gptel property change,\nincluding only model text (nil / 'response) and excluding 'ignore\n(reasoning, tool fences) and (tool . id) (tool call/result content).\nBoth the per-response and cross-response guards now use it.\n\nThe interesting part: the fix had to be property-aware, not text-aware.\nA regex for \"``` tool\" would miss the org-mode variant (#+begin_tool)\nand would be fragile. Walking by text-property is the honest approach\n-- gptel already marks what it inserts; the fence just needs to read\nthe marks.\n\n3 new tests: 30 identical tool-block previews + 5 model lines must NOT\nfire; model lines still accumulate across responses; tool-result\ncontent excluded. Suite 1098/1098 green, commit 7723022 pushed.\n\nThe bass line holds. The fence can now tell its own scaffolding from\nthe model's speech.\n"}]
