[2026-09-08 04:22:51] REQ 260908042120-26 START backend=Ollama model=deepseek-v4-flash:cloud msgs=52 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_yzh6xsow","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/i.ar && git log --oneline --all 2>/dev/null | grep -i \"glued\\|sentinel\\|be9fff6\" | head; echo \"---has be9fff6?---\"; git cat-file -t be9fff6 2>&1; echo \"---origin---\"; git log --oneline origin/main 2>/dev/null | head -3"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[04:22:51] be9fff4 continuo c76: fix glued-sentinel completion miss (c75 exit-1 root cause). deepseek-v4-flash wrote the sentinel as \"CYCLE_COMPLETECYCLE_COMPLETE\" glued on one line (no newline between the two tokens); iar--cycle-complete-p's own-line regex (^\\\\(?:CYCLE_COMPLETE\\\\)\\\\s-*$) missed it, the cycle fell through to the text-only runaway detector (the repeated line looked like a runaway), and exited 1 with no completion. Fix: + quantifier on the sentinel group (^\\\\(?:CYCLE_COMPLETE\\\\)+\\\\s-*$) accepts one-or-more repetitions on the line, while still rejecting a sentinel glued to arbitrary text. 3 tests: glued CYCLE_COMPLETE->cycle, glued LOOP_COMPLETE->loop, sentinel+other-text->not-completion. Differential-verified: old regex fails both glued tests. Suite green 1045/0.\nd768f37 execute_code_remote honest-failure preflight (sidecar fix C): the Emacs container ships no podman client, so EVERY local sidecar exec since the sidecar existed failed with 'Searching for program: No such file or directory, podman' -- re-signaled by the outer handler as a generic error, invisible to failure-first (cycle exit stayed green; the audit bridge logged the callback as success). The sidecar has been a healthy organ with a cut nerve for 4+ days (knowledge/aria/research-sidecar-wiring.md). Fix: preflight executable-find before spawning; missing binary returns an honest diagnosis (what is broken, do not retry, where the fix belongs) instead of a generic re-signal. Same guard for the ssh leg. No cl-return-from (rule 48): cond-structured preflight. Tests: 3 new (podman-missing honest error + no spawn, ssh-missing honest error, binary-present proceeds to dispatch through a real short-lived process carrying the tool's own sentinel). Suite 991/991. Real fix (socket bridge) remains an interactive-session security decision.\nd20b127 fix: setq-default for agent name/file -- async sentinels resolved nil\n5991310 prompts: fix sentinel drift in agent_cycle_continue.org\nc32ad40 fix: setq-default for agent name/file -- async sentinels resolved nil\n4e4cb63 prompts: fix sentinel drift in agent_cycle_continue.org\n6097ba4 refactor: Steps 1.4 + 1.7 + 1.8 + 1.9 -- requires, nil sentinel, prompt loader, aliases\n6b36f76 darwin: fix sentinel buffer-local capture bug in code_tools.el\nd51ea6d darwin: fix dead-buffer crash in async shell sentinel (code_tools.el)\n0b66d67 darwin: add CYCLE_COMPLETE sentinel to continue-prompt, fix missing provide in code_tools.el, add requires to 7 test files for self-containment\n---has be9fff6?---\nfatal: Not a valid object name be9fff6\n---origin---\n79a7c87 continuo c65: fix mute failure channel -- CYCLE_TAG unbound under set -u (agent-failure-notify.sh)\n6c6b6d2 gptel.el: add deepseek-v4-flash:cloud to models list (composition: continuo substrate)\n52142bf fossil audit: mark i.ar-repo audit/iar/aria as stale (last live 2026-08-30, pre-Step5 migration; live tree is iar-personalization)\n"}]
